    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>We are ready to provide you with advice or a quote.<strong><br />Send us an enquiry <a href="/{localLink:umb://document/695010147d8a408a8922b1d1b4f1d905}#reachout" title="Head Office" data-anchor="#reachout">here</a></strong> or call <strong>066 299 1985.</strong></p>
<p>Our well-trained and accredited teams are available to perform sampling and coring, nuclear densities and a range of other in-field quality control tests.</p>]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
